WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.970
Hawkeye and I
are working on a case.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.547
Uh and we needed
to use the bathroom.

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:06.965
I, uh, he..
he did.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.134
So, we were by the house
and we dropped in. No big deal.

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:10.844
Working on a case together?
-How terrific!

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.304
He's my partner.

00:00:13.823 --> 00:00:15.015
We're not partners.

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:17.809
Well, we're
friends-slash-partners.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.686
I wouldn't really describe
us as friends.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.353
&lt;i&gt;[phone beeps]&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:25.150
Someone used my laptop
to sign on to my work account,

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:26.609
ten minutes ago.

00:00:27.087 --> 00:00:28.445
Any thoughts, Kate?

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:31.162
&lt;i&gt;Hawkeye?&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:33.950
Oh, you'll...you'll never
get anything out of him. 

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.745
See, CB1 has trouble opening up.

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:38.038
Uh, nobody calls me CB1.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.414
I'm just trying it out
for a second. 

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.791
Probably some early
childhood thing.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:44.085
&lt;i&gt;He thinks he doesn't tell me&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;much but he ends up &lt;/i&gt;

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:45.503
kind of telling me all of it.
-I virtually tell her nothing.

00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:46.171
Um, but, yeah.

00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:47.881
I think it's cause
I'm generally just pretty chill.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.924
You know, not like,
“Oh my god! Hawkeye!”

00:00:50.906 --> 00:00:51.906
Definitely not chill.

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:56.181
By the way, thank you

00:00:57.053 --> 00:00:58.224
for saving the world.

00:00:59.697 --> 00:01:00.697
Don't mention it.

